<title>POLAND: POLISH KPW CLEARS ECHO RIGHTS ISSUE.</title>
<headline>POLISH KPW CLEARS ECHO RIGHTS ISSUE.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-09-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Polish Securities Commission (KPW) cleared a 1.5-million rights issue of Echo SA publisher, KPW said in a statement.</p>
<p>The company earlier set the rights issue price at six zlotys per share and the record day on October 25.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
